  "label": "Slavery in America",
  "description": "The historical system of chattel slavery that existed in the United States from the colonial period until the 13th Amendment in 1865. The meme implies that Black people's identity was 'replaced' by slavery, which is a historically inaccurate and racially charged claim that attempts to erase the distinct history and identity of African Americans.",
